<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's oil product prices unchanged for August.</title>
<headline>Morocco's oil product prices unchanged for August.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's fuel oil prices will remain unchanged in August at 1,662.9 dirhams ($175) per tonne, the energy ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Gas oil will be sold at 4.71 dirhams a litre and kerosene also unchanged at 3.24 dirhams a litre.</p>
<p>Pump prices for ordinary and super petrol will remain at 7.42 and 7.65 dirhams respectively.</p>
<p>($1 = 9.8 dirhams)</p>
</text>
